<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — OrderProfit by Loomic"
  appName="OrderProfit"
  lastUpdated="February 20, 2026"
>
  <p>It is OrderProfit's policy to respect your privacy regarding any information we may collect while operating our website. This Privacy Policy applies to OrderProfit (hereinafter, "us", "we", or "OrderProfit"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting personally identifiable information you may provide us through the Website. We have adopted this privacy policy ("Privacy Policy") to explain what information may be collected on our Website, how we use this information, and under what circumstances we may disclose the information to third parties.</p>

  <p>This Privacy Policy applies only to information we collect through the Website and does not apply to our collection of information from other sources. This Privacy Policy, together with the Terms and Conditions posted on our Website, set forth the general rules and policies governing your use of our Website. Depending on your activities when visiting our Website, you may be required to agree to additional terms and conditions.</p>

  <h2>Website Visitors</h2>
  <p>Like most website operators, OrderProfit collects non-personally-identifying information of the sort that web browsers and servers typically make available, such as the browser type, language preference, referring site, and the date and time of each visitor request. OrderProfit's purpose in collecting non-personally identifying information is to better understand how OrderProfit's visitors use its website.</p>
  <p>From time to time, OrderProfit may release non-personally-identifying information in the aggregate, e.g., by publishing a report on trends in the usage of its website. OrderProfit also collects potentially personally-identifying information like Internet Protocol (IP) addresses for logged in users and for users leaving comments on blog posts. OrderProfit only discloses logged in user and commenter IP addresses under the same circumstances that it uses and discloses personally-identifying information as described below.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>The security of your Personal Information is important to us, but remember that no method of transmission over the Internet, or method of electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your Personal Information, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.</p>

  <h2>Links To External Sites</h2>
  <p>Our Service may contain links to external sites that are not operated by us. If you click on a third party link, you will be directed to that third party's site. We strongly advise you to review the Privacy Policy and terms and conditions of every site you visit. We have no control over, and assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies or practices of any third party sites, products or services.</p>

  <h2>Aggregated Statistics</h2>
  <p>OrderProfit may collect statistics about the behavior of visitors to its website. OrderProfit may display this information publicly or provide it to others. However, OrderProfit does not disclose your personally-identifying information.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>To enrich and perfect your online experience, OrderProfit uses "Cookies", similar technologies and services provided by others to display personalized content, appropriate advertising and store your preferences on your computer.</p>
  <p>A cookie is a string of information that a website stores on a visitor's computer, and that the visitor's browser provides to the website each time the visitor returns. OrderProfit uses cookies to help OrderProfit identify and track visitors, their usage of the website, and their website access preferences.</p>
  <p>OrderProfit visitors who do not wish to have cookies placed on their computers should set their browsers to refuse cookies before using OrderProfit's websites, with the drawback that certain features of OrderProfit's websites may not function properly without the aid of cookies. By continuing to navigate our website without changing your cookie settings, you hereby acknowledge and agree to OrderProfit's use of cookies.</p>

  <h2>Information Collected from Shopify Merchants</h2>
  <p>When you install the OrderProfit app, we are automatically able to access certain types of information from your Shopify account via the Shopify API:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Store Information:</strong> We collect your shop's domain, email address, and shop owner information to provide you with our services, handle billing, and offer technical support.</li>
    <li><strong>Order and Product Data:</strong> We access your store's order history, product information, and cost data to calculate profit margins, generate analytics, and provide comprehensive profitability reports. This includes order details, product costs, shipping costs, and transaction fees.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics Data:</strong> We collect and process sales metrics, conversion rates, and performance indicators to provide you with actionable insights about your store's profitability and help you make data-driven business decisions.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Data Protection & Mandatory Webhooks</h2>
  <p>OrderProfit complies with Shopify's mandatory webhooks to ensure your data and your customers' data is handled according to GDPR, CCPA, and other data protection regulations:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Customer Data Request:</strong> If a customer requests their data from your store, we will provide any data we have stored upon Shopify's request.</li>
    <li><strong>Customer Data Erasure:</strong> If a customer requests their data be deleted, we will purge any related records from our databases.</li>
    <li><strong>Shop Data Erasure:</strong> 48 hours after you uninstall OrderProfit, we will automatically initiate a process to delete all personal data associated with your store from our systems.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information or your customers' data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

  <h2>Privacy Policy Changes</h2>
  <p>Although most changes are likely to be minor, OrderProfit may change its Privacy Policy from time to time, and in OrderProfit's sole discretion. OrderProfit encourages visitors to frequently check this page for any changes to its Privacy Policy. Your continued use of this site after any change in this Privacy Policy will constitute your acceptance of such change.</p>

